---
import faqsData from '../data/faqs.json';
---

<section id="preguntas" class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-white border-t border-purple-100 scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center space-y-4 mb-14">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-700 font-semibold">
        Claridad & Transparencia
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
        Preguntas <span class="font-serif italic font-normal text-purple-800">Frecuentes</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Resolvemos tus principales dudas sobre cómo prepararte, cómo agendar y qué esperar durante tu visita a P.A.S Estética Holística.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion using semantic accessible HTML details/summary (0 KB JS) -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      {faqsData.map((faq, index) => (
        <details class="group bg-stone-50 border border-purple-100 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-purple-300 open:bg-purple-50/40">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-slate-900 text-base sm:text-lg focus:outline-hidden focus:text-purple-800 select-none">
            <span class="pr-4">{faq.question}</span>
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white group-open:bg-purple-700 group-open:text-white text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-purple-200 group-open:border-transparent transition-all duration-200">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="pt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-purple-100/60 mt-3">
            {faq.answer}
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Extra assistance card -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100/60 border border-purple-200/70 text-center space-y-3">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-purple-950">¿Tienes alguna pregunta específica sobre tu tipo de piel?</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-purple-900/80 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Escríbenos directamente a WhatsApp y Paula te orientará de forma personalizada sin ningún compromiso.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/573118735759?text=Hola%20Paula,%20tengo%20una%20consulta%20espec%C3%ADfica%20sobre%20mi%20piel"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-purple-700 hover:bg-purple-800 transition-colors shadow-xs"
        >
          Consultar por WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
